     "text": "GPU: Optimize Throughput of a Large Number of Simple Threads\n   Issue of SIMD Utilization: Control Divergence\n\n\n\n\n\n¡  Increasing SIMD utilization with divergence-free\n   programs.\n\n\n\n     Compute(threadIdx.x);\n\n     if (threadIdx.x < 32){\n\n       Do_this(threadIdx.x * 2);\n\n     }\n\n     else{\n\n       Do_that((threadIdx.x%32)*2+1);\n\n     }",
